Notice I added me-3 (margin-right) classes to each element. This is the most reliable approach since it doesn't rely on CSS overrides that might be blocked by your existing layout CSS.

The me-3 class applies margin-right: 1rem which will create the visible gaps you're looking for between the dropdown, buttons, and info text.
